            "is_preorder": false,
            "datePublished": "11 Sep 2011 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "In memory of the people who jumped from the WTC ten years ago.\nAll money made from this ep will go to the Samaritans.\nelizabeth Veldon is a (sometime Harsh) Noise Artist who is influenced by Abstract Art, Minimalism and the Avant Guards as much as by the pull of fucking loud noises. Her music is not meant to be taken too seriously but is sometimes deadly serious.\nelizabeth has been making music in one form or another for over five years and has moved from early Tape Music and processed guitars towards using found sound, samples, loops and sine waves.\nelizabeth's music is entirely synthetic and she makes no apology for that.",
            "credits": "released September 11, 2011",
            "license": "Attribution Non-commercial",
